  "title": "Pumpkin Pecan Biscuits",
  "description": "Pumpkin puree and toasted pecans combine irresistibly in these easy sweet biscuits that are a perfect addition to your Thanksgiving table.",
  "authors": [
    "Kristina S"
  ],
